      en: ["Headquarters of the Belle Vue Mauricia sugar mill in the northern plains", "Home to the award-winning 'L'Aventure du Sucre' interactive museum", "Operates a major power-generation plant in partnership with global firms", "Pioneer in diversifying the traditional Mauritian agricultural economy", "Produces high-quality rums at its on-site boutique distillery", "Developing the 'Beau Plan Smart City' to modernize the northern region", "Manages a significant fleet of heavy machinery for mechanized harvesting", "Major supporter of cultural and educational heritage projects in the north"],
