      en: ["Leading logistics hub located north of the capital city, Port Louis", "Excellent access to the M1 motorway and the main maritime port", "Hosts the primary distribution centers for major national supermarket chains", "Location for numerous automotive showrooms and specialized service centers", "Features specialized storage facilities for chemicals and industrial goods", "Major regional employer for the population of the Pamplemousses district", "Infrastructure includes modern high-speed broadband and dedicated power lines", "Headquarters for many firms in the construction and metal-work industries"],
