      en: ["Hub for the Mauritian tuna canning industry for global export", "Hosts state-of-the-art processing plants certified for the EU market", "Important location for small-ship maintenance and maritime services", "Key component of the national strategy to promote the 'Blue Economy'", "Provides thousands of jobs in the seafood processing and logistics sectors", "Strategically located between the main harbor and the northern resorts", "Features specialized cold-storage logistics and private fishing quays", "Works in close collaboration with international deep-sea fishing fleets"],
